Algorithm attribution
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

PhantomKey implements the Master Password algorithm (version 3), originally
designed and documented by Maarten Billemont (Lyndir). The algorithm uses:

  - scrypt key derivation (N=32768, r=8, p=2, dkLen=64)
  - HMAC-SHA-256 site seed generation
  - password type templates (Maximum, Long, Medium, Basic, Short, PIN, Name, Phrase)
  - namespaces under "com.lyndir.masterpassword" for authentication and login

PhantomKey is an independent Free Software project and is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or an official product of Maarten Billemont, Lyndir, the Master
Password project, or the Spectre project.

References:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Master_Password_(algorithm)
  https://gitlab.com/MasterPassword/MasterPassword

